      "user_id": 90586,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768078604733332
    },
    {
      "text": "I can certainly look into that for you. Pulling up 91-Victor-4... I see the Aero-Dynamic Helmet. To make sure I get this right, what specifically is the issue? Is it a technical fault or a preference?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
